**ODP:** Event

**Question:** What is the name of the event that occurs when a Power Outage happens at an MDU Site or affecting any nbn® Equipment located at that MDU Site?
**Answer:** any Power Outage at an MDU Site or affecting any nbn® Equipment located at that MDU Site
**Classes:** `Cl_ExclusionEvent`, `Cl_PowerOutage`
**ODP:** Event

**Question:** What is the name of the event that occurs when a Power Outage affects an nbn® Node or any other active equipment that forms part of the FTTB Network or the FTTN Network and is not located within a Type 1 Facility or a Type 2 Facility?
