3) Competency Question Alignment

**Question:** What is the name of the threshold that triggers utilisation management when more than 90% of a Shared Network Resource has been utilised for a continuous period of 30 minutes or more on at least 3 separate days within any rolling 30-day period?
**Answer:** Utilisation Threshold
**Classes:** `Cl_UtilisationThreshold`
**ODP:** Property Reification

**Question:** What is the numeric value of the utilisation percentage that defines the Utilisation Threshold?
**Answer:** 90%
**Classes:** `Cl_UtilisationThreshold`
**ODP:** Quantities and Units

**Question:** What is the duration of the continuous period of utilisation that must be exceeded to trigger the Utilisation Threshold?
**Answer:** 30 minutes
**Classes:** `Cl_UtilisationThreshold`
**ODP:** Temporal Extent

**Question:** What is the minimum number of separate days within any rolling 30-day period on which the utilisation must exceed the Utilisation Threshold?
**Answer:** 3
**Classes:** `Cl_UtilisationThreshold`
**ODP:** Property Reification

**Question:** What is the duration of the rolling period used to count the separate days for the Utilisation Threshold?
**Answer:** 30-day period
**Classes:** `Cl_UtilisationThreshold`
**ODP:** Temporal Extent

**Question:** What is the name of the performance objective that nbn must meet to return utilisation of a Shared Network Resource to below the Utilisation Threshold?
**Answer:** Utilisation Management Performance Objective
**Classes:** `Cl_UtilisationManagementPerformanceObjective`
**ODP:** Event

**Question:** What is the numeric value of the time within which nbn must return utilisation of a Shared Network Resource to below the Utilisation Threshold?
**Answer:** 15
**Classes:** `Cl_UtilisationManagementPerformanceObjective`
**ODP:** Temporal Extent

**Question:** What is the unit of the time within which nbn must return utilisation of a Shared Network Resource to below the Utilisation Threshold?
**Answer:** Business Days
**Classes:** `Cl_UtilisationManagementPerformanceObjective`, `Cl_BusinessDay`
**ODP:** Temporal Extent

**Question:** What is the name of the rebate that nbn offers in respect of the performance of nbn® Ethernet (FTTB), nbn® Ethernet (FTTN) and nbn® Ethernet (FTTC) TC-4 Ordered Products upon connection?
**Answer:** FTTB/N/C Connection Performance Rebate
**Classes:** `Cl_FTTBNCConnectionPerformanceRebate`
**ODP:** AgentRole

**Question:** What is the numeric value of the FTTB/N/C Connection Performance Rebate amount per Ordered Product?
**Answer:** $21.22
**Classes:** `Cl_FTTBNCConnectionPerformanceRebate`, `Cl_Charge`
**ODP:** Quantities and Units

**Question:** What is the unit of the FTTB/N/C Connection Performance Rebate amount per Ordered Product?
**Answer:** per nbn® Ethernet (FTTB), nbn® Ethernet (FTTN), or nbn® Ethernet (FTTC) TC-4 Ordered Product
**Classes:** `Cl_FTTBNCConnectionPerformanceRebate`, `Cl_AvcTc4OrderedProductComponent`
**ODP:** Quantities and Units

**Question:** What event triggers the increase of the FTTB/N/C Connection Performance Rebate amounts?
**Answer:** the start of each financial year from and including 1 July 2025
